{"authored" [{"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/state.json" "file_sha256" "17374b52377599dede2a15c883d45326524032b972d8cc29a2ff0e5d5334ad8c" "basis" 1296 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that ${cot}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}$ to express this as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/state.json" "file_sha256" "17374b52377599dede2a15c883d45326524032b972d8cc29a2ff0e5d5334ad8c" "basis" 1296 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ce191542b27f7f51d6b6ef778426f64d00c2b3bdc3edfb369c14f54dac6911a4" "basis" 1296 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/state.json" "file_sha256" "17374b52377599dede2a15c883d45326524032b972d8cc29a2ff0e5d5334ad8c" "basis" 1296 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038169/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-49257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{\\pi /8}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡(2x)}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x.$ Then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we fill the table for the limits of integration, according to the rule $u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x.$\n\n| $x$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{8}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ | $1$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /8}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡(2x)}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\sqrt{2}/2}^{1}\\frac{1}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{u}{|}_{\\sqrt{2}/2}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "668f28534358e8bfc057371230bada2af15b98677fb3fd758d428440467bc2ff"} {"question" "q-49257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "1"] ["math" "2-\\sqrt{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{2}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}-1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sqrt{2}-1"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that ${cot}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}$ to express this as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{cos}^{3}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}({cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{3}⁡x+\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+{csc}^{2}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "668f28534358e8bfc057371230bada2af15b98677fb3fd758d428440467bc2ff"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-49273" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{{sin}^{2}⁡4x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{{sin}^{2}⁡4x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}=\\operatorname{cot}⁡4x$ and $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}=\\operatorname{csc}⁡4x$ to express this as\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡4x\\operatorname{cot}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=4x.$ Then $\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡4x\\operatorname{cot}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{csc}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{csc}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "668f28534358e8bfc057371230bada2af15b98677fb3fd758d428440467bc2ff"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cot}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{csc}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{4}{sin}^{2}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}{cot}^{2}⁡4x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}{csc}^{2}⁡4x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-74279" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{csc}⁡4x+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\operatorname{tan}⁡x{sec}^{3}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We use the identities $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ and $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}$ and rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{tan}⁡x{sec}^{3}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x})}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{cos}^{3}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{cos}^{4}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this by substitution. Let $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$ Then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,⟹\\,-\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{cos}^{4}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{u}^{4}}\\,(-\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-\\int \\frac{1}{{u}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3{u}^{3}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3{cos}^{3}⁡x}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{sec}^{3}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "668f28534358e8bfc057371230bada2af15b98677fb3fd758d428440467bc2ff"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3{csc}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "3{sec}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{3}{csc}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{3}{sec}^{3}⁡x+C"] ["math" "{sec}^{2}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114294" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{3}{sec}^{3}⁡x+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x$ and $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ to express this as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-[\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})] \\\\  & =-[1-\\sqrt{2}] \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "668f28534358e8bfc057371230bada2af15b98677fb3fd758d428440467bc2ff"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\sqrt{2}"] ["math" "3\\sqrt{2}-2"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-2}{3}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}-1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"} {"question" "q-114318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sqrt{2}-1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069279/state.json" "file_sha256" "184084c214d0054ace6bf656a7585f57eb5e07358b8c09c07616ed59d6ac940f"}] "usage" {"q-49273" []} "basis" 2356 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [17592186063155 17592186063156 17592186063157 17592186063158 17592186063159] "immutable_fields" [[17592186063154 :answer-field/correct] [17592186063154 :answer-field/id] [17592186063154 :answer-field/key] [17592186063154 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
